  "body": "Discreetly positioned behind a private gate, this elevated home is beautifully oriented to offer a commanding sense of presence, delivering a rare combination of established privacy and exceptional space. Surrounded by mature greenery and expansive lawns, the property provides a peaceful, park-like environment that feels worlds away from the hustle and bustle, yet remains thoroughly functional for everyday family living.\r\n\r\nThe grand scale of the property is felt immediately upon arrival, welcomed by a functional entranceway. Designed with multi-generational family living in mind, the generous layout features multiple formal and casual living zones, thoughtfully connected by a central double-sided fireplace. These living areas flow naturally out to the timber decks and wide-open lawns, making the backyard a seamless, private extension of the home. The main kitchen is well-appointed with quality appliances and ample storage, supported by a walk-in pantry that makes managing a large household or hosting gatherings incredibly easy.\r\n\r\nThe layout is exceptionally accommodating for families of all stages, offering a substantial 7 bedrooms and 5.5 bathrooms across two masterfully planned levels. On the ground floor, a private wing features a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and its own ensuite, alongside two further comfortable bedrooms, a full family bathroom, and the added convenience of an independent kitchenette. With its own garden access, this zone offers excellent separation for extended family, teenage retreats, or long-term guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the space continues with a massive secondary living lounge, creating the perfect secondary family hub. The main master suite serves as a quiet retreat with peaceful bush views, dual walk-in wardrobes, and an ensuite with a freestanding bath. A second upstairs suite features its own private ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while the remaining two comfortably oversized bedrooms are serviced by yet another fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe expansive outdoor grounds are a true highlight of this substantial property, offering an enviable lifestyle of comfort and leisure. The massive, flat lawn and wrap-around deck areas provide the perfect private setting for summer barbecues, lively family gatherings, or outdoor relaxation, while offering a safe, secure, and endless space for children and pets to run around and play freely. Practicality is equally assured with a triple internal-access garage and plenty off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location offers a highly desirable coastal lifestyle for growing families. The property is ideally located close to Long Bay Village for shopping and dining, as well as nearby coastal reserves and scenic walking tracks. It provides excellent educational pathways, being in zone for highly regarded local schools including Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College, while the Albany Centre is just a convenient 10-minute drive away for wider amenities. This is an excellent opportunity to secure a substantial, deeply comfortable home on a generous section in a prime position.",
